{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:00 2026-08-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>2020年落選港姐廖慧儀（Jessica）擁有令人稱羨的完美線條，加上熱愛戶外運動，因此不時在社交平台大派福利。近日廖慧儀再次飛到度假天堂峇里島，連環分享旅行影片，當中一條滑水片，火速成為網民焦點。</p>\n<h2>廖慧儀身材Fit爆</h2>\n<p>廖慧儀此次峇里之旅可謂行程緊密，除駕駛綠色電單車穿梭當地，展現颯爽的一面外，廖慧儀又出海滑水（Wakesurfing）。片段中可見，廖慧儀換上粉紅色比堅尼，毫無保留地展現零死角的Fit爆身材，廖慧儀表現有板有眼，緊握拉繩在浪花中隨波起伏，平衡力與靈活性十足。</p>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀早前參加綜藝真人騷《魔音女團》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09b03f2d2537195f6b877e8b2a908db1/2026-08/liu.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀大晒緊緻美背及蛇腰，女人味十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21e504995857f54cf2852a29c0d856f3/2026-05/22_0_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀脫去灰色外套又唱又跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b31fccb30dfef4431a27a1a89e4a2e2/2026-05/28_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀因擁索爆身材兼樣貌端好而備受網民注意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b6d9b3d5f0cabc0daa316d871a38bc3/2025-08/newayyee_yoga_1752484477_3676428718207213477_37611750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀是一名運動健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80b4d6ac84f4724c587f8de15d9f782b/2025-08/newayyee_yoga_1752484477_3676428718500828165_37611750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀經常晒泳裝照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dab2c8bd96c8b3b76b6dc21b0d75d6f/2023-09/341348520_1581773948964653_174199316388377689_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀的泳衣非常緊身，令胸部變形。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2630e3d9b3252cfa3cde36a5607172e7/2024-08/snapinsta_1_S.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀飛赴度假勝地峇里島放鬆身心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff4344769726ca00974692ee5cc84a3f/2026-08/JessicaLiu_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀駕駛搶眼綠色電單車穿梭當地街頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d300e2bc7b87850c73c190b7b5e65666/2026-08/JessicaLiu_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀昨日（11日）在IG分享滑水片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f823fe4ff9f78fc9cbc7ad0bae410db5/2026-08/JessicaLiu_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀穿上救生衣滑水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32116b949b048613f46b9dd7f56720f2/2026-08/JessicaLiu_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀舉起勝利手勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87db876407c9e9792cb09c5fa04eb7f7/2026-08/JessicaLiu_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀另一條滑水片險些走光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3c7a0ebff85424df69a4002c6e8bbc4/2026-08/JessicaLiu_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀要拉扯比堅尼上身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ece83c14ca9a4bde02a174ba8487a9fb/2026-08/JessicaLiu_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀穿上比堅尼滑水，陷甩Top邊緣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20c04be3b7914c91570e5fb0117a64cb/2026-08/JessicaLiu_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀緊握拉繩踏在滑水板上隨波起伏，展現出極佳的平衡力與運動細胞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbdd49cb7b8742f062782b52abf28c64/2026-08/JessicaLiu_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀上衣一度被強大水流沖至移位，幸而迅速單手拉實泳衣衣角修正。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd8c0313d0f563073867472d0bdddbf8/2026-08/JessicaLiu_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀大晒曲線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e854bea7b2f06e5c77b8fff179d339ec/2026-08/JessicaLiu_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀早前一個人到峇里旅行，送上火辣比堅尼照派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6a6b6037ddd7f1527bcab24d6bf4c90/2026-06/1_13_59.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀騎上電單車，尤如冇着褲一樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6198643d7f6e79da6cab57cf55c05b77/2026-06/2_8_63.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀穿着性感做運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab79dd4900600df2d69c7fa1c54a8340/2026-06/4_7_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾晒出沖涼片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f945001d3932b96c6baaded8544017d7/2025-12/9_2_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀換上比堅尼，身材曲線一覽無遺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a8b1cbc5cac74c2a6a8133d1106056d/2025-12/10_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀運動後到水療中心進行冷熱水浸浴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b02be6878c7ed09fc09f313deb637e8f/2025-12/12_1_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"素顏上陣的廖慧儀皮膚狀態極佳，散發出健康性感魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c09efa5802fa96ebb3b7e314c1465954/2025-12/15_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀將焗桑拿過程記錄下來。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8aa3a83efb9db563f74c54922f86a2bf/2025-12/16_12.jpg\"/>\n<p>不過廖慧儀滑水期間，多度要調整泳衣，由於快艇翻起的浪花衝擊力強勁，加上滑水動作幅度不小，廖慧儀在彎腰與起立控制平衡的瞬間，遭水流將比堅尼上衣沖至移位，一度陷入走光邊緣。</p>\n<h2>廖慧儀滑水險象環生</h2>\n<p>廖慧儀留言：「不要離我太遠，掉頭望一眼就見」，而其震撼視覺的滑水片曝光後，引起網民熱烈討論，不少人留言大讚：「這身材簡直太完美」、「動靜皆宜，玩滑水有型又有性感」、「真係險象環生，小心走光啊」。</p>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾有「狂野空姐」之稱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ec050072de2427440ebeefe7ccaec08/2023-05/0230_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀予人戰鬥格感覺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29dfd988e2a4953ddd14bf07e7b2a14f/2023-05/newayyee_yoga_316364208_439432631695730_6787833426278642445_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀2020年選港姐入行，當時被封「狂野港姐」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7495b6f31db50dde8666b407f52b298e/2023-09/liaohuiyi01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀參選時被挖出不少性感火辣照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53670a1048d61deb2cf3fbb5f9f3ee2a/2023-05/94890210_255880808898131_737814667190755053_n%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀當選後曾因感情事而被雪藏一年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/008736b5e094c9f3e0492ad627bffc84/2022-10/lui7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀因前男友輕生而形象插水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/545240ccccd27d01f2e608aee23a961a/2025-08/newayyee_yoga_1752484477_3676428718232367130_37611750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀入行前與舊愛Sam愛得火熱，但入行後卻突然分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86854a9164205209ebd038021764f7f4/2025-08/a5_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀參選期間傳戀上孔德賢，隨後發生前度墮樓輕生事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b29da4b6c14f558c342476238f492a8/2025-08/a6_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"港姐出身的廖慧儀是瑜伽教練。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3273f1d7a13d2989f5c2e3dab0e27fb8/2023-07/340307566_531835622355736_4162631496333598748_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jessica寓興趣於搵錢，收工後Keep住做瑜伽導師。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c6a458e3ed7fd36647f96245563b02d/2023-06/liu%20%284%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀獲解凍後，於2021年《歡樂滿東華》環節中擔任旗手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3961dbe57dc7889f168d8554de317897/2023-06/3_2_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾加入無綫娛樂新聞台做主播，邊學邊做。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/845eb0f4006de658373bdde8e330b205/2023-06/15_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀成為J2er，有份拍節目《港女野人》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4c8ceb93930aed8606fad3be6a2da32/2022-10/lui.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《港女野人》算是廖慧儀的翻身之作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bef41ca5a96ff242fccb4922a9e2ac85/2023-05/35-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾在《關注關注組》以導師身份指導幾位主持做雙人瑜伽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ad5cc0ac1ee9e03c4eac1dbd9ce0724/2023-07/5_51.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾主持飲食節目《開火》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3564a214e60cc32eba7230e5014c230/2023-05/newayyee_yoga_323685867_560448959000856_59560211112502117_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀之後與伍韻婷再合作主持《唔滾唔知有料到》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b2586623b9f76aad612a8f6f08a8806/2024-04/VS--newayyeeyogaInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾在《網紅甜卡》與黎紀君到英法拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22321268a9f23467d2bd12b98bb424e6/2024-04/VS--newayyeeyogaInstagram-0_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀客串拍新劇《奪命提示》，穿小背心跟力捧姐仔劉佩玥對打。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8709369248193c92088c41c70c2fd2ba/2023-06/_DSC7951.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TVB四大「新一代咪神」（前左起）廖慧儀、何泳芍、陳若思（後左）和胡美貽均是港姐出身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/576614b3bbf9c1cffa30527fac6adc56/2024-01/GONGNUI_00.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"四女主持的J2行山真人騷《港女野人》播出後掀起不少迴響。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2234cc4c792b3f7fb61799caaf0d4528/2024-01/GONGNUI_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"四人僅穿Bra top挑戰港九新界不同難度系數山野。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97041469c69139c926b27083b4993416/2024-01/GONGNUI_01b.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"節目中她們幾乎集集拋波騷腹肌，成功俘虜一班宅男觀眾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c0da43999124647a8debac1f7ed3d60/2024-01/GONGNUI_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀於社交網批露《港女野人2》已飛抵紐西蘭取景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05d43826bf2a1ff3fa7148c68c54a972/2024-01/GONGNUI_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀附上以低胸Sports Bra輕露事業線靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90f57f87d3761cc0878564660fd9da57/2024-01/GONGNUI_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"（左起）胡美貽、何泳芍、陳若思及廖慧儀大晒火辣水着Look，當中心口晒到兩截色的胡美貽最吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c390650db07bbbcab9a3b3b4b3f422d1/2024-01/GONGNUI_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"四人上山下海挑戰體能及耐力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0c0cfee97931015525cc96b40c0c909/2022-10/35-1%20-%20%E8%A4%87%E8%A3%BD.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀曾在《黑色月光》表現有驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3de7687b25d061c64848098bb7176a7d/2024-10/VS--Aliplay-0_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀被林俊其飾演的年青版蔣基俊落藥迷姦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1235add40d8b730a00a93d2a61f9ecae/2024-10/B01_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鏡頭出現廖慧儀被手扣鎖手兼強吻的畫面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7a4574ec25b4e613aad78b8619a20e4/2024-10/B01_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀一方面慘叫反抗，另一方面得悉妹妹區明妙亦被侵犯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaa1b2827334a97ddd95665bc95089a9/2024-10/B01_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀第一時間了解妹妹情況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a53c5170e590ee2eac90711612a3bd94/2024-10/VS--Aliplay-0_37_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖慧儀在《黑色月光》演出大受讚賞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49ce1858149cf23d6ff8d6e70f2a257e/2024-11/33_2.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T00:50:19.224555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":458,"images":59,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}